---
// Interactive engine surface. Two columns of clickable verbs (READ left,
// WRITE right) with a central hub. Click a verb to expand a panel below
// with the request / response shape and a one-line description.
//
// The data here is hand-curated to match the actual engine endpoints in
// ~/automation/api/* on the M1. Mocked response bodies are short and
// representative — they should read as authentic to anyone who has used
// the engine.

